# GRASS-SETTLE: the first frame after opening FIELD_Barn must not show a grass cell of another colour with a straight
# edge (FOLIAGE-PROOF 10-28, 1_field_grass lower left), and three seconds later the same view must not jump.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_first the first frame after opening: no grass cell of another colour with a straight edge (lower left)
Когда advance 3
Тогда-вид 2_settled the same view three seconds later: the same grass as 1_first, no jump
